      "worked_solution": "The diagram shows a circle of radius $|a|=|-3.5|=3.5$ centered at the point $(-3.5,0).$ \n\nIn polar coordinates, the equation of such a circle is given by \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =2a\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-3.5)\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =-7\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
